<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia has expelled the United Arab Emirates ambassador after accusing Abu Dhabi of converting civilian airfields in Somaliland and Puntland into military bases and funding armed groups that undermine national unity. Federal forces quietly relaunched the previously failed Banooda operation, moving a major troop convoy, while U.S. airstrikes hit al-Shabaab at three locations across the country. The United States reversed its stance, now funding UN military support in Somalia for another year after previously withdrawing that funding. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOSnVXZTRHeHhvcHhsZGVHNENMZWphYWdZZGxfdmE1NUVKRlB6YUdQT0tlZnZqX0hlYWx6cmdyeHl0NmktNXc5Q2d0RlNzTEhhMjZWUmxnX1NTNm1kNjBscEFkaEdCYWM2UFd0cWRtWXZLaTZheWVMTTlUblRGeWlacnM3NWkxeXdEUkRraVZnbWs3M3FzLTdSMnd4UC1yNUtaLWh3allFMVVEb2ZIR0RxYWxSQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE5vdjZUR2NpZnRyQnBLX0k3RDZfM0NLUEFRcFY3cmxBaDRXVzNMTnBSU2R2b1ZEUnBNREhwd3BaVnFLZm9oTTBBUE5vN2FVNkRETjdMUGxMTkVFcGh6cVNzT2JSeUEtSDNfQWpkOG1sZTE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxObV9tbGZJTGd4SzhPSGItQ3FHcnZ5aWhkNHVubHlNMWJDanczR0dwN1hRYlFESWpUMEJUTlhiOTEtRmN3ekZCZHdncFBaVV82ampyTS1QMlpVSlpRck9DVFFfT0pCTFh6dDZOaThlYTRfQTBMNVRUVXFEaHZPb0NYa0p1VVpCVmVOOHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQLVBKVk1FWFpIN25md0NDU3ZDNkpsWlVEdU8tbGpqNVFIQWFZd3lSOVRTc0RBZXptTEJKenFjeWgtYnJQVnN1a2VHMFdONkVfcHJjTHZUZTVUTVZibkM4aDdSY2NLNE40N3NqdkZlTHY0TGRVeWxuY2dTX3lRRGFqYXdETkh4cjFLclVBTm5OeWw0cnNHNFdhcG9sQzNVUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shabelle Media Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: